From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tiberiu Chibici <chibicitiberiu@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:18:38 +0200
Subject: Walnut: the GTK 3 flavour only, without the features a PS3 browser
 leaves out

Only the 4.1 API (GTK 3) flavour is built, for Badwolf: no GTK 4 (6.0) packages, no documentation, no introspection data, no WebDriver, no MiniBrowser. Left out at build time: WebGL and WebGPU, WebRTC, media capture and recording, WebAudio, WebCodecs, speech synthesis, encrypted media, GStreamer GL, gamepads, geolocation, spellchecking, libsecret, AVIF and JPEG XL, PDF.js, the remote inspector, the Wayland target, journald logging, and the bubblewrap sandbox (no namespaces on the PS3's kernel). <video> and Media Source stay, with GStreamer; the plugins recommended are libav only (base and good are Depends), not plugins-bad or gstreamer1.0-gl. The build profile pkg.webkit2gtk.novideo also drops GStreamer, for measuring. On ppc64 the code is scheduled for the Cell PPE (-mtune=cell; the instruction set stays the baseline). dpkg-gensymbols does not stop on API symbols that the left-out features take with them.

